            "schemaMarkup": "<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n{\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n  \"@type\": \"FAQPage\",\n  \"mainEntity\": [\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"What does a content marketing agency actually do?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"A content marketing agency develops a strategy, writes helpful content, searches optimizes, and positions your content to reach your audience. Instead of aimlessly posting blogs, this agency integrates research, SEO, writing, and brand voice to build trust, answer your audience’s questions, and attract qualified leads. Audience and keyword research SEO content and blog writing Conversion copywriting Brand storytelling and social content Performance tracking and refinement The goal is simple: turn your expertise into content that ranks, builds trust, and brings in leads.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"How much do content marketing services cost?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"The cost varies based on your needs, industry, competition, and preferred content volume per month. Some brands are successful with a low volume, low cost plan while other brands request a high value, high volume plan. Good content marketing services are clear about their offerings and flexible while focusing on the results you can see.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"How long before content marketing shows results?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"Most brands start to see results within 3 to 6 months. 6 to 12 months is the realistic growth window. This varies based on your website and your competition. Consistent, quality content will pay off because it continues to attract leads for years.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"What's the difference between content marketing and just writing blogs?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"Blogging is part of a bigger idea with content marketing. Good content marketing connects all the dots with your blogs, pages, and messages with your audience’s needs, keywords, and brand voice, and aligns with your goals. It’s a whole process, from research and writing to optimization, publishing, and tracking, to ensure your content works as a unified growth system instead of random posts.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"Do you offer B2B content marketing?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"Yes. We help B2B brands create content for longer sales cycles, cautious buyers, and complex decisions. As a B2B content marketing agency, we write thought leadership, service pages, and helpful content that explains your value, eases doubts, builds trust, and keeps your brand visible until buyers are ready.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"How is your content optimized for Google AI Overviews and AI search?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"We structure content so Google, AI Overviews, and AI tools can read it clearly. That means simple answers, clean headings, useful detail, and strong coverage of your topic. The aim is content that’s easy for readers to trust and easy for search systems to pull from. Leading sections with clear, direct answers Using clean structure and semantic depth Building topical authority around your niche This answer-engine focus helps your brand appear as the cited source, not just another link buried below the summary.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"Will the content actually sound like our brand?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"Yes. Your content should sound like your business, not a generic agency template. We get to know your voice, audience, services, and goals first. Then we shape every blog, page, and post around your style, so your brand feels natural, trustworthy, and easy to remember.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"Do you write SEO content or just creative copy?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"Both, because strong content needs visibility and good writing. SEO helps people find your pages, and creative copy keeps them reading and moves them to act. We blend keywords, search intent, plain language, and clear selling points, so your content can rank and convert.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"Do you handle social media content too?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"Yes. We write social content that gives your brand a clear voice, a steady rhythm, and a stronger message across platforms. Instead of filler posts, we create content that educates, engages, and builds trust. We can handle writing alone or full social content planning.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"How do you measure content marketing ROI and what reporting do I get?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"We measure ROI by tracking the numbers that matter to your business, things like keyword rankings, organic traffic, leads, conversions, and content performance. You also get clear updates on what’s improving, what needs work, and how each piece supports your long-term growth.\"\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}\n</script>"
