            "faqSchemaMarkup": "<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n{\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n  \"@type\": \"FAQPage\",\n  \"mainEntity\": [\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"What exactly is included in social media management services?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"Social media management services cover everything needed to run your accounts well, so nothing slips through the cracks. With us, that means: A clear strategy and monthly content calendar Post design, captions, and short videos Scheduling and publishing at peak times Community replies to comments and messages Paid ad support when you want it Honest monthly reporting It is fully done-for-you, so you simply review and approve.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"How much does social media management cost?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"Cost varies on how many platforms you operate, how frequently you publish, and if you include sponsored advertisements. Most brands begin with a concentrated bundle and build up as results develop. We’re open about our pricing, so you’ll always know exactly what you are paying for and why.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"Which social platforms do you manage?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"We manage the platforms where your buyers actually spend time, not every app for the sake of it: Instagram and Facebook LinkedIn TikTok Pinterest and YouTube where they fit We recommend the right mix instead of stretching you thin.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"How soon will I see results?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"In the first few weeks, you’ll frequently see early signals like increased engagement and reach. You normally need two to three months to create big outcomes like consistent leads and sales as your content compounds and your audience expands and warms up.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"What is the difference between organic and paid social?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"Organic content fosters long-term trust and engagement for free, while sponsored advertisements purchase immediate, targeted reach. The best results come from combining both, and that’s how our social media advertising services drive growth without squandering funds.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"Why hire an agency instead of doing it in-house?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"A social media management agency gives you a full team’s skills for less than one salary. You get strategy, design, ads, and reporting in one place, without the cost, training, and risk of hiring and managing it all internally.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"Do you create the content, or do I?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"We handle it end to end. From visuals and captions to scheduling and replies, our smm services cover the entire process. You simply review, approve, and watch your pages grow without doing any of the heavy lifting yourself.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"Will you reply to comments and messages?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"Yes. Active community management is core to what we do. We answer comments, mentions, and DMs in your brand voice, turning quick interactions into trust and trust into loyal, repeat customers over time.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"How do you measure success?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"We track what truly matters: engagement, reach, follower quality, leads, and sales. Then we share clear monthly reports in plain language, so you can see real progress instead of confusing numbers with no context behind them.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"Can social media really grow my sales?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"Yes, when it is done with intent. Consistent, useful content builds trust, attracts the right audience, and guides people toward buying. The whole point is turning attention into steady, trackable revenue, not just likes that look good.\"\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}\n</script>",
