            "faqDescription": "Explore common questions regarding our turnaround times, process, deliverables, and engineering standards.",
            "faqSchemaMarkup": "<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n{\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n  \"@type\": \"FAQPage\",\n  \"mainEntity\": [\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"How much should I budget for Meta ads each month?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"It depends on your goals and market, but most small businesses gain real traction around $1,000 to $1,500 monthly in ad spend, plus management. Smaller budgets work, but learn slower with fewer conversions. Competitive niches and bigger goals need more fuel. We start where you are comfortable, then scale as results earn it.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"How soon will I see results from Meta ads?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"Most accounts show early signals within two to three weeks, with steadier results by month two or three. Our meta ads management services spend the first weeks gathering data and finding winning creative, then scale what works.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"What is the difference between boosting a post and running proper ads?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"A boosted post chases likes, while a real campaign chases the action that makes money. Boosting gives Meta little direction, so it serves cheaply to easy reactions. A focused meta advertising agency sets a clear goal, tracks cleanly, and targets real buyers, which is why it usually pays off.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"Do you run both Facebook and Instagram ads, or just one?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"We run both, often together, since they share one ad system and audience pool. Most accounts perform best when Facebook and Instagram work as one machine, with creative tailored to each feed and budget sent to the cheapest placements.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"How do you actually lower my cost per lead?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"We lower it by fixing what quietly inflates it, then doubling down on what works. Cleaner tracking so the algorithm finds real buyers. Stronger creative that earns clicks without raising costs. Cutting weak placements and refreshing ads before fatigue spikes spend. This steady meta ads optimization brings your cost per result down over time.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"What is Advantage+ and do you use it?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"Advantage+ is Meta’s AI campaign system that automates targeting, placement, and budget, and we use it where it wins. For many ecommerce and lead accounts it lifts return on ad spend, but it is not magic, so we feed it strong creative and keep manual control where precision matters.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"Will you create the ad images and videos, or do I provide them?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"We handle creative direction and production, though good raw material from you always helps. Our team builds vertical video cuts, scroll stopping visuals, and tested hooks in house, so you are not stuck filming everything. Since creativity now drives most results, we never leave it to chance.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"How do you track whether the ads are truly making money?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"We track real outcomes, not vanity metrics, using the Pixel, Conversions API, and blended return on ad spend. Because Meta’s in app numbers can over or under report, we cross check against your real sales and show what each dollar returned.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"Can Meta ads work for local or service businesses, not just ecommerce?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"Absolutely, and local service businesses often see the fastest wins. We target nearby buyers, lead with proof and clear offers, and capture warm interest with retargeting. From clinics to home services, the right campaign brings a steady stream of calls and bookings.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"What do I need to get started, and how does onboarding work?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"You mainly need a Facebook business page, ad account access, and your offer, and we guide you through the rest. A quick strategy call to learn your goals and numbers. A full audit of your account and tracking setup. A clear plan, then build, launch, and ongoing optimization. Most clients live within the first week of kickoff.\"\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}\n</script>",
