              "enabled": true,
              "description": "A click is not a customer, and a strong account always knows the difference, which is exactly why our google ads management services tune every campaign so your budget chases buyers ready to call, book, or check out today, not idle browsers who waste spend and never come back.\n\nMost owners who come to us were once sold “leads” that turned out to be wrong numbers and tire kickers. So we measure what actually pays: booked jobs, qualified calls, and real sales. Your account is judged on revenue and return, never on impressions that look busy but earn nothing, the way an honest google ads agency should work."
            },
            "whatIncluded": {
              "eyebrow": "03 // WHAT'S INCLUDED",
              "titleIntro": "Google Ads Services We Tailor To",
              "titleHighlight": "Your Margins And Market",
              "pillars": [
                {
                  "title": "Google Ads Campaign Management",
                  "desc": "Your account should be built around outcomes, not options. We structure Search, Performance Max, and Demand Gen campaigns to cover the full funnel, then optimize daily. As your core google ads campaign management services, this is the hands on, week in week out work that keeps cost per result falling while volume climbs.",
                  "features": []
                },
                {
                  "title": "Google PPC Management",
                  "desc": "Paid traffic only pays when every click is accountable. Our google PPC management services control match types, prune wasted search terms, sharpen audiences, and reset bids around real conversion data. The result is a leaner pay per click account that spends less to win the same buyers, then reinvests the savings into growth.",
