                "question": "How much does Google Ads management cost?",
                "answer": "It depends on your ad budget and how competitive your market is, not a flat one size fee. As a guide: Management is usually a monthly fee or a share of ad spend Your media budget sits separately and goes straight to Google The right spend is whatever still returns a profit per lead or sale We help you set a starting budget that can prove returns before you scale.",
