            },
            {
              "question": "How can I tell if my business needs local SEO?",
              "answer": "If a customer were to type in a search of your services, and you wish to appear in the results, you need local SEO. This improves your chances of landing in the map pack and further increases the number of potential customers calling you, visiting you, or purchasing from you instead of your competitors.",
