            },
            {
              "question": "How is SEO professional different from basic SEO?",
              "answer": "Basic SEO focuses on a handful of keywords. SEO professionals take a more holistic approach that combines multiple strategies to improve customer outreach tactics; this can include technical enhancements, content improvements, and authority building. This integrated approach explains, in part, the measurable results these services provide.",
