            },
            {
              "question": "Can I expect an increase in sales from eCommerce SEO?",
              "answer": "Definitely. eCommerce SEO offers a way to enhance the visibility of your products, improve the experience of your webpage, and streamline the buying process. This type of SEO attracts customers who have a strong intent to buy, and this type of enhanced visibility of your products encourages browsing customers to complete their purchase.",
