            "hero": {
              "titleIntro": "Google Ads Management Services That Make",
              "titleHighlight": "Every Click Pay For Itself",
              "description": "Roughly half of every Google Ads account we audit is quietly leaking money on the wrong searches, broken tracking, or bids set on guesswork. Our google ads management services plug those leaks first, then scale what works, so your budget starts buying real customers instead of expensive lessons.\n\nYou set a budget to grow sales, not to feed clicks that never convert. At Mohsin designs , we rebuild your account around clean conversion data, tight match controls, and bidding that chases revenue instead of vanity metrics. That is the gap between an account that drains cash and one that compounds it.\n\nPlenty of providers launch a campaign, flip it live, and vanish behind a monthly report. We work the other way around. Our google ads services stay glued to your numbers every week, cutting waste, testing offers, and pushing every campaign toward a cost per lead your business can actually scale on.",
