              "enabled": true,
              "description": "A click is not a customer, and a strong account always knows the difference, which is exactly why our google ads management services tune every campaign so your budget chases buyers ready to call, book, or check out today, not idle browsers who waste spend and never come back.\n\nMost owners who come to us were once sold “leads” that turned out to be wrong numbers and tire kickers. So we measure what actually pays: booked jobs, qualified calls, and real sales. Your account is judged on revenue and return, never on impressions that look busy but earn nothing, the way an honest google ads agency should work."
