                {
                  "title": "Google PPC Management",
                  "desc": "Paid traffic only pays when every click is accountable. Our google PPC management services control match types, prune wasted search terms, sharpen audiences, and reset bids around real conversion data. The result is a leaner pay per click account that spends less to win the same buyers, then reinvests the savings into growth.",
                  "features": []
                },
