              ],
              "enabled": true,
              "description": "Seven-plus years in real product design taught us more than any trend could. Since 2019, we’ve served over 3,000 global clients and US businesses across 50+ industries, giving us a battle-tested read on what makes people click, stay, and buy. That range is why our work moves real numbers, not just portfolios.\n\nFigures like $5 million in client revenue and a 95%+ client retention rate don’t come from luck. They come from doing the work ourselves. With zero outsourcing, every wireframe, screen, and prototype is built directly by the principal architect, which is why over 90% of clients come back for their next project."
            },
            "whatIncluded": {
              "eyebrow": "03 // WHAT'S INCLUDED",
              "titleIntro": "UI/UX Solutions Shaped Around",
              "titleHighlight": "How Your Users Behave",
              "pillars": [
                {
                  "title": "User Research & Strategy",
                  "desc": "Designing based on subjective perceptions leads to bad design. That is why we analyze your target audience and your potential market using interviews, data, and mapping to outline and identify pain points. Using this data ensures that every design decision made is based on the reality of your potential users.",
                  "features": []
                },
                {
                  "title": "Wireframing & Prototyping",
                  "desc": "Before investing in visual design, we flesh the structure of the design. Our wireframes and prototypes help conduct early design usability testing, and help identify unexpected design flows and sticking points. It helps us stay within budget and materialize design concepts that are user research focused.",
                  "features": []
