                "answer": "Your new website will work well on mobile phones. Our web design and development agency takes a mobile first design approach and every website that we build is customizable and responsive. Because the majority of web traffic is from mobile devices, we focus on mobile website performance first.",
                "category": "GENERAL"
              },
              {
                "question": "What is the real difference between UI and UX design?",
                "answer": "Both UI and UX design address web design in some form. Design elements, such as color and placement, are aspects of UI design. Conversely, the ability to navigate the website with ease is considered UX design. We believe the most effective web design services integrate UI and UX design.",
                "category": "GENERAL"
              },
              {
                "question": "Can you redesign my current website instead of starting over?",
                "answer": "Definitely. We’ll evaluate your site and identify elements that we can preserve. We’ll correct problems that are costing you leads, such as messaging, speed, and mobile responsiveness. A redesign can quickly improve your site’s conversions without the need for a complete rebuild.",
