                  "features": []
                },
                {
                  "title": "Blog Writing & Editorial Strategy",
                  "desc": "Your business's blog should not include your personal views. It should provide content that meets the needs of readers. We create blog topics that are centered around the needs of your target customers and create a publication schedule that improves your site's authority. Each post is created to draw in readers without the need for a sales call.",
                  "features": []
                },
                {
                  "title": "Social Media Content Writing",
                  "desc": "In the age of fast media your posts will vanish along with your audience. With our services, we give your social media channels a distinct voice and a constant flow of creative posts that will convert scrollers into community members. This service also pairs well with our active social media management service that allows you to transfer strategy and posting to us.",
                  "features": []
                },
                {
                  "title": "Brand Storytelling",
                  "desc": "People remember stories. They don't remember features. We translate the story of your 'why' and your unique mission into a powerful message. We help you stay on-brand and make an impact wherever you go. Good brand content marketing makes your brand memorable, and your audience will never be able to compare your price to your value.",
                  "features": []
                },
