                  "num": "02",
                  "title": "Content That Ranks And Reads",
                  "desc": "Then we create pieces that work for search engines and skeptical readers alike. Clean structure, strong hooks, and solid on-page work help pages rank, while sharp writing keeps people reading long enough to act."
