                  "features": []
                },
                {
                  "title": "Local Citations and NAP Consistency",
                  "desc": "Google becomes confused by conflicting business data, and it hurts rankings. We develop and clean correct citations across reputable directories, cementing your name, address and phone into one consistent footprint that increases visibility and local trust.",
                  "features": []
                },
                {
                  "title": "Posts, Photos and Profile Content",
                  "desc": "Regular photographs on profiles get 42% more directions requests and 35% more clicks. We improve your photos, offers, descriptions and Google posts so your listing seems current, genuine and is definitely worth picking over the company one slot above you.",
                  "features": []
                }
              ],
              "enabled": true,
              "description": "No two local markets act alike, thus a copy-paste arrangement never wins. Whether you’ve got one store or fifty, we do everything from profile management and recovery, to map rankings, to reviews and citations, all targeted to your business to make sure that every piece works together to generate consistent local leads."
