              "titleHighlight": "Daily, Paying Users",
              "description": "While the global app market continues to grow, apps continue to struggle with user retention. 93% of users will stop using an app within the first month of its launch. We aim to solve this problem. We create apps that draw users in from day one, building the habit of daily use, and making users dependent on the app for weeks and even months later.\n\nOur team at Mohsin Designs know that not every great idea comes with a developer team ready to build. Some of those ideas even have apps in beta, but that are still unstable. Both of these are obstacles that are easy to overcome. We’ll create your idea and build it, while we manage our budgets and constrains.\n\nHanding your project to faceless subcontractors is how most agencies work, and it is how vision gets lost. We do the opposite. As a hands-on app design and development company, every screen, line of code, and release is built directly, so your idea ships exactly the way you pictured it.",
