              "titleIntro": "Website Design Agency That Wins the Click",
              "titleHighlight": "and Closes the Sale",
              "description": "People make a decision on trusting your business in about 0.05 seconds. Design makes or breaks 94% of that impression. A slow or a clumsy site will send potential buyers to your competitors. Mohsin Designs makes the sites that help you capture that first impression and continues to do so in the long run.\n\nMost business owners do not need one more aesthetically pleasing template. They need sites that load quickly, rank on Google, and lead users to make a call, fill a form, or make a purchase. We focus on the actual behavior of buyers rather than the trends that look good but do nothing for your sales.\n\nThere are many studios that will sell you a look and then disappear. We focus on the results of your site and so, our site makes sure to sell the services and act as a part of your sales team. Each layout decision we choose, each speed fix we implement, each button we design, aims to get you more qualified leads and more sales that you can count.",
