              "titleHighlight": "Behind Your Screen",
              "description": "We plan, design, and build your site’s structure and interface with fast and high-converting layouts, to ensure the frictionless user experience and search engine crawlability. That’s the real work behind a site that sells, versus the many templates that never deliver.\n\nPeople often think of their site as an employee that isn’t working. Visibly, a site either sells to the visitor, or it doesn’t. This is often the cause of a high bounce rate; once a visitor leaves a site, 88% of the time, they will never return. Effective design stops that. To execute that we focus on three foundations:",
              "components": [
                {
                  "num": "01",
                  "title": "Structure first",
                  "desc": "Clean structure and crawlable code let search engines understand your pages and visitors find what they need in a click. This separates a site that ranks from one hiding on page two."
                },
                {
                  "num": "02",
                  "title": "Experience second",
                  "desc": "Thoughtful UI and UX remove friction, cutting confusion and nudging people toward action. Since $1 spent on UX can return roughly $100, this is the smartest money in the build."
