            "description": "When done right, social media handles everything for you. Strategy, content, scheduling, replies, and management of your paid ads. With social media, your brand is visible to the right people, and every post works to grow your presence. Think about how many times you mindlessly tap an app. Each scroll is an opportunity for a brand to be recognized. We make sure yours is noticed.\n\nNow, think of your pages the way you think of a warm storefront instead of a dusty notice board. Since social management is done the right way, it quickly builds trust and connects your business to the audience you want. That makes it really easy for a potential customer to send you a message, leave you a comment, or place their order on your website.\n\nTo make that happen, we focus on three core areas:",
            "components": [
              {
                "num": "01",
                "title": "Brand Voice & Visuals",
                "desc": "A scattered look kills trust fast. We shape one clear voice and a steady visual style so your feed feels intentional, recognizable, and worth following at a glance."
              },
              {
                "num": "02",
                "title": "Audience Growth",
                "desc": "Next, we grow the right followers, not bots. Through sharp targeting and shareable content, we attract people who genuinely fit your offer and are likely to buy."
