            "eyebrow": "04 // HOW IT WORKS",
            "titleIntro": "What Strong Design Really Does To",
            "titleHighlight": "Your Bottom Line",
            "description": "Strong graphic design services do three jobs at once: they make your brand easy to recognize, build quiet trust through consistency, and steer the eye toward action. The result is simple. The right people notice you, believe you, and choose you faster than they choose the next option.\n\nRecognition comes first, and most of it happens without thinking. The brain processes visuals significantly quicker than it does words, therefore a strong visual identity is remembered, a weak one is scrolling past. Trust comes next, and consistency is how you gain it. A brand that is the same everywhere seems secure. People purchase from brands that feel safe.",
            "components": [
              {
                "num": "01",
                "title": "Instant Recognition",
                "desc": "A clear identity comes first. We build logos, color systems, and type that work together, so your brand is spotted at a glance and never mixed up with the competitor sitting right below you."
              },
              {
                "num": "02",
                "title": "Earned Trust",
                "desc": "Next, we lock that look across every touchpoint. When your posts, brochures, and site graphics all speak the same visual language, your business reads as solid, organized, and worth a higher price."
