      "schemaMarkup": "{\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n  \"@type\": \"FAQPage\",\n  \"mainEntity\": [\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"What makes you a digital marketing agency Australia businesses can actually trust?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"We are a full-service agency that covers everything from SEO and paid ads to website building and branding. Because we are full-service, we can ensure that all of your marketing efforts are seamless, leading to no wasted time, resources, or leads.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"How much do your services cost?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"Pricing depends on the specifics of your goals, your market, and the services themselves. We determine the cost of a marketing plan according to your budget and are transparent about our pricing. Because of our approach, we are the most approachable digital marketing agency Australia has to offer. Request a free quote for a budgetary plan.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"How is SEO different from content marketing?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"SEO focuses on rankings and technical health so search engines find and trust you. Content marketing builds the value that turns visitors into buyers. They work best as a pair:\\nSEO gets you found by the right people\\nContent convinces those people to choose you\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"What do I get from your Google Ads management?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"Advertising to the target market is done through click ready ads. Unlike other digital marketing agencies in Australia, we focus on ROI. We do all the leg work including keyword research, writing ads, bidding, creating landing pages, and reviewing the data to ensure your budget is focused on what brings the most conversions and not what helps no one.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"Why does social media matter for my brand?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"Because your customers are already there every single day. As a performance marketing agency at heart, we post consistently, reply to your audience, and run campaigns that build real engagement. Over time that steady presence keeps you top of mind and turns quiet followers into paying customers.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"How does GMB optimization help me locally?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"Most local buyers start on Google Maps, so a sharp profile is huge. We optimise yours with:\\nThe right categories and service details\\nFresh photos and regular posts\\nActive review replies that build trust\\nThat combination drives more calls, visits, and directions from nearby buyers.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"Can you help if my website is slow or outdated?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"Of course. Every day slow, unattractive websites quietly lose hundreds of sales. We provide a custom rebuild of your website so you lose no more sales. A website should work like the best salesperson, and with our services your website will be working day and night for your business instead of leaving customers to go to the competition.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"Do you actually do the work in-house?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"We do all the work ourselves to ensure the customer retains the same level of service throughout the process. Customer satisfaction is our number one policy and we value your business more than anyone, so we will always keep you in the loop and give you updates as frequently as necessary.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"How soon will I see results?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"With SEO you won’t see the benefits for a couple months, but you can pay for ads to see almost immediate results. You will receive honest time estimations and updates in a no jargon format. You will see the improvements we report, and the measurements will make sense to you, instead of you having to fill in the gaps to get the result.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"Why choose a local team over a cheaper overseas option?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"Because local context wins sales here. A digital marketing agency Australia businesses now understands how Aussies search, buy, and compare, then applies that to proximity targeting, local landing pages, and messaging that clicks. It’s the difference between spend that leaks and spend that actually converts.\"\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}",
