                  "badge": "Service"
                },
                {
                  "step": "02",
                  "title": "On Page SEO",
                  "desc": "Each page on your website has the potential to be ranked. We enhance page titles, headings, and meta descriptions. We also improve the content and internal links of each page to ensure it is keyword focused. We help both search engines and potential site visitors understand your page and its offerings to improve engagement and rankings.",
                  "badge": "Service"
                },
                {
                  "step": "03",
                  "title": "Off Page SEO",
                  "desc": "To obtain a strong ranking, your website must have trust signals from sources outside your website. We earn trust from outside sources by building backlinks, gaining relevant mentions and online authority, through ethical link building. When trusted websites point to your pages, your website is seen as credible, which helps you outperform your competitors.",
                  "badge": "Service"
                },
                {
                  "step": "04",
                  "title": "SEO Audit",
