              "schemaData": "<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n{\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n  \"@type\": \"FAQPage\",\n  \"mainEntity\": [\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"How much do website development services actually cost?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"This is dependent on the services you need. A simple brochure website is less expensive than a custom e-commerce website with various integrations. The breakdown typically looks like this: Simple custom sites sit at the lower end of most quotes Business sites with a CMS land in the mid-range E-commerce and custom web apps cost more because they’re far more complex Affordable web development does not mean we sacrifice speed or security to meet your budget. We are clear about the pricing and scope of your project.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"How long does it take to build a website?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"The typical custom website build time is weeks to months, and is dependent mostly on size and complexity of the site. The smaller the business site, the quicker the build. Custom feature business sites are larger and complex, and take longer. During our discovery process, we set your custom build time with a realistic deadline, and we set specific goals to manage progress so you always know what to expect.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"Will my website work properly on phones?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"Absolutely, and this is a must. Over 60% of web users are on mobile devices and Google prioritizes mobile indexing so we ensure all of our builds include mobile responsive website development. We guarantee your site provides mobile users a fast and smooth experience just like desktop visitors.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"Should I choose WordPress or a fully custom build?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"It comes down to control versus flexibility: WordPress is ideal if you want to edit content yourself easily and launch efficiently Custom builds suit complex features or unique functionality a theme can’t handle As a WordPress website development company that also does custom work, we’ll recommend whichever genuinely fits your goals, not whichever is easier for us.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"Can you fix or redesign my existing website?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"Of course. Many clients prefer our services because their current site is slow and outdated. We have the option of building you a whole new site, or improving the site you currently have with our WordPress theme customization, offering faster loading times, cleaner code, and better rates of conversion while maintaining the most functional aspects of your current site.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"What's the difference between front-end and back-end development?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"To think of a quick analogy, the front end of a site is similar to the lobby and dining area of a restaurant, while the back end is similar to the kitchen. Our services cover both areas of development, and our full stack development services cover the integration of both.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"Will my new website actually help me rank on Google?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"Google will recognize fast load time and mobile first designs and will rank them higher. Your build will not replace SEO, however, sets a solid foundation. We make sure search engines can easily crawl and understand the sites we build. So when you do SEO, the site aligns with your goals, instead of working against you.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"Do you only build new sites, or do you offer custom features too?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"Both. Beyond standard builds, we handle custom website development services like booking systems, member portals, API integrations, and tailored functionality most templates can’t support. If you’ve got a specific idea, we’ll scope whether it’s realistic, what it takes, and how to build it without breaking your budget or your timeline.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"What happens after my website launches?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"Launch is the start, not the finish. We monitor performance, fix anything that surfaces, and keep your site secure and updated. As a web development company that builds long-term relationships, we offer ongoing support and maintenance, so your site stays fast, safe, and reliable instead of slowly falling apart after handoff.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"Why hire a web development company instead of using a website builder?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"DIY builders look cheap until they cost you sales. They’re slow, hard to customize, and rarely built to convert. Professional web development solutions give you a faster, fully tailored site engineered around your buyers, so instead of a generic page that just exists, you get one that actively earns its keep.\"\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}\n</script>"
