: \"Yes, always. We build and manage everything inside your own account, so you keep full ownership of the data, history, and conversions. If we ever part ways, the account and all of its learnings stay completely yours.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"Can you fix an account that is already wasting money?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"Absolutely, and that is where we add value fastest. Our google ad account audit pinpoints leaks like broken tracking, loose match types, and irrelevant clicks, then we rebuild around clean data so your existing budget starts returning far more.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"What is Performance Max and AI Max, and should I use them?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"They are Google’s AI driven campaign types that run across Search, Shopping, YouTube, and more. They can boost reach and conversions, but only with strong creative, clean tracking, and tight guardrails. Left alone, they overspend, so we keep a human steering them at all times.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"Do you offer Google Ads consulting if I already have a team?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"Yes. Our google ads consulting services give your in house team senior strategy, audits, and clear direction without taking over daily work. You stay in control while we sharpen account structure, bidding, and your approach to newer campaign types.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"How is your PPC management different from a cheap freelancer?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"Cheap usually means hands off. Our google PPC management services include weekly optimization, clean conversion tracking, and honest reporting from a senior specialist, not the occasional login. You are paying for accountability and returns, not just someone with account access.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"Does Google Ads work for a small or local business?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"Often even better than for big brands. Tight geo targeting and high intent local searches mean a modest budget can win real customers. If buyers search “google ads agency near me” style terms for your service, smart local campaigns put you right in front of them.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"Why hire a Google Ads agency instead of doing it myself?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"DIY is possible, but it is expensive while you learn. A focused google ads agency brings tested structure, current platform knowledge, and the time to optimize daily, so you skip the costly mistakes and reach profitable results far faster.\"\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}\n</script>"
