                  "icon": "",
                  "image": "https://mohsindesigns.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/All-Stars-Exteriors.jpg"
                },
                {
                  "name": "American Stone Sealer",
                  "icon": "",
                  "image": "https://mohsindesigns.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/American-Stone-Sealer.jpg"
                }
              ],
              "enabled": true,
              "description": "Strategy that never touched a live account breaks the moment real money is on the line. Across clinics, home service crews, and online stores, we have launched, fixed, and scaled campaigns by hand, which lets us spot a losing ad in days, not weeks.\n\nBig promises are cheap, so we skip them. As a results first meta advertising agency, we focus on the work that moves revenue, like clean tracking, smarter audiences, and steady creative testing. Paired with consistent social media management , that foundation makes results repeatable, not lucky."
            },
            "whatIncluded": {
              "eyebrow": "03 // WHAT'S INCLUDED",
              "titleIntro": "Paid Social Campaigns Shaped Around",
              "titleHighlight": "Your Buyers, Not A Template",
              "pillars": [
                {
                  "title": "Facebook Ads Management",
                  "desc": "Facebook still reaches the widest mix of ages and buying intent, making it ideal for cold reach and retargeting alike. We build clean campaign structures, set the right objective, and tighten budgets at the ad set level, so delivery stays steady while your cost per lead keeps steadily falling.",
                  "features": []
                },
                {
                  "title": "Instagram Ads Management",
                  "desc": "Instagram is where visual brands win attention fast, especially in Reels and Stories, where short vertical video earns near organic reach. We craft scroll friendly creative for 9:16 video, hook viewers in three seconds, and keep on screen text readable, giving the algorithm strong signals to scale your ads.",
                  "features": []
                },
                {
                  "title": "Pinterest Ads Management",
                  "desc": "Pinterest catches people while they are planning and shopping, not just scrolling for fun, which means real buying intent at a lower cost. We set up product and idea pins, match keywords to actual searches, and route clicks to a fast page, turning quiet browsing into steady, affordable sales.",
                  "features": []
                },
                {
                  "title": "TikTok Ads Management",
                  "desc": "TikTok rewards content that feels native, so polished commercials flop while honest, fast paced video wins. We script creator style ads, test multiple hooks, and use platform signals to find buyers, not just viewers, then recycle the winning angles across the whole rest of your social media advertising services.",
                  "features": []
                },
                {
                  "title": "Meta Retargeting & Conversion Campaigns",
                  "desc": "Most people never buy on the first visit, so retargeting wins them back without paying full price for cold traffic again. We build warm audiences from site visitors, video viewers, and past engagers, then time tailored offers using clean Pixel and Conversions API data that recovers otherwise lost sales.",
                  "features": []
                }
              ],
