            "strategy": {
              "eyebrow": "04 // HOW IT WORKS",
              "titleIntro": "What Meta Ads Management Services Really Do",
              "titleHighlight": "Behind The Scenes",
              "description": "Meta runs an auction millions of times each second, scoring your ad against thousands of others using interest, behavior, and past actions. Winning it at a fair price is the whole job, so your business reaches people likely to buy, not just scroll past.\n\nPicture your ad account as a sorting machine, not a billboard. Done right, it learns who buys and who wastes spend, then funds the winners and starves the losers. That loop only spins when three things are dialed in.\n\nTo make that happen, we lock down three core areas:",
              "components": [
                {
                  "num": "01",
                  "title": "Pinpoint Targeting",
                  "desc": "Reaching the right buyers comes first. We build custom audiences from your Pixel, layer in lookalike and Advantage+ audiences, and cut placements that drain spend."
                },
                {
                  "num": "02",
                  "title": "Thumb Stopping Creative",
                  "desc": "Targeting fails if the ad gets ignored. We write hooks that stop the scroll in three seconds and build native, vertical formats for Reels and Stories with our graphic design team."
                },
                {
                  "num": "03",
                  "title": "Honest Tracking & Optimization",
                  "desc": "Numbers decide the next move. We set up the Pixel and Conversions API correctly, watch blended return on ad spend, and adjust budgets in steady steps."
                }
