            "faqDescription": "Explore common questions regarding our turnaround times, process, deliverables, and engineering standards.",
            "faqSchemaMarkup": "<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n{\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n  \"@type\": \"FAQPage\",\n  \"mainEntity\": [\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"How much does a professionally designed website cost?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"The cost will vary based on the number of pages, website features, and overall goals. Business websites tend to be less expensive than fully custom ecommerce websites. As a custom website design agency, we are transparent about our process and provide clear quotes so you only pay for what is necessary to grow your business.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"How long does it take to design and launch a website?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"Most sites go live in 3 to 8 weeks, based on size and complexity. Small business site: around 3 to 4 weeks Larger or CMS-driven site: 5 to 6 weeks Ecommerce or custom builds: 6 to 8 weeks Clear content and quick feedback keep timelines tight.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"Will my new website work well on mobile phones?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"Your new website will work well on mobile phones. Our web design and development agency takes a mobile first design approach and every website that we build is customizable and responsive. Because the majority of web traffic is from mobile devices, we focus on mobile website performance first.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"What is the real difference between UI and UX design?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"Both UI and UX design address web design in some form. Design elements, such as color and placement, are aspects of UI design. Conversely, the ability to navigate the website with ease is considered UX design. We believe the most effective web design services integrate UI and UX design.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"Can you redesign my current website instead of starting over?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"Definitely. We’ll evaluate your site and identify elements that we can preserve. We’ll correct problems that are costing you leads, such as messaging, speed, and mobile responsiveness. A redesign can quickly improve your site’s conversions without the need for a complete rebuild.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"Can I edit and update the website myself after launch?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"For sure. We design your site so that, even on launch day, you can edit and update your site. We design your site on an easy to use platform and, more importantly, so that you and your team are trained to use the site effectively well after we are done with it.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"Will a new website actually help me rank on Google?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"Yes. A new site built with clean code and fast loading times and a clear and logical structure with crawling ready SEO and web pages built to be indexed by search engines. Our web design incorporates SEO from the beginning to ensure your site is built correctly.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"Do you build ecommerce stores as well?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"Absolutely! Our ecommerce web design includes pages that house your products, a secure checkout process, and an overall ecommerce structure designed to reduce abandonment and increase your sales. Coupled with our web design services, your ecommerce site will be fast and secure with an increase in traffic.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"Why hire an agency instead of using a website builder?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"Website builders give you templates, whereas a website design agency gives you a plan. A website design agency gives you the framework, the speed, and the services your site needs to give your business the return it deserves.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"What makes Mohsin Designs different from other agencies?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"Your work is done by a senior member of staff and measurable results. Your work is done by a team with years of experience and proven design and honest web pricing. The site we build will help your business grow.\"\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}\n</script>",
