            "hero": {
              "titleIntro": "Grow Faster With A Content Marketing Agency That",
              "titleHighlight": "Turns Words Into Revenue",
              "description": "Brands often lose customers because of a lack of effective communication, not because of bad products. Our goal is to target those customers and help you reach them with the type of content they are already searching for with the right message, to make them take the desired action.\n\nThe way customers search has drastically changed. Customers now use AI tools such as search engines, ChatGPT and AI Overviews to answer their questions and decide to trust the source that seems most reliable. We help to make sure that you are that trusted source so that your brand is seen as the answer instead of an afterthought.\n\nWe know that you have probably hired freelancers, seen a few blog posts and questioned if content has value. Content definitely has value, but only with a clear strategy. As your content marketing agency, we connect everything to your buyers, the most valuable keywords and to measurable goals.",
