            "faqBadge": "FREQUENTLY ASKED QUESTIONS",
            "faqTitleIntro": "Frequently Asked",
            "faqTitleHighlight": "Questions",
            "faqDescription": "Explore common questions regarding our turnaround times, process, deliverables, and engineering standards.",
            "faqSchemaMarkup": "<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n{\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n  \"@type\": \"FAQPage\",\n  \"mainEntity\": [\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"How long does it take to design a logo?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"Most logos take one to two weeks from start to final files, depending on the package and how fast feedback comes back. The rough breakdown: Discovery and research: 1 to 2 days First concepts: 3 to 5 days Revisions: 2 to 4 days Final files and handover: 1 day Need it sooner? Tell us your deadline and we will build a realistic plan around it.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"Will I own full rights to my logo?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"Yes, completely. Once your project is paid and finished, 100% of the rights transfer to you, including the editable vector source files. Your logo is yours to trademark, print, and use anywhere, forever, with no licensing fees.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"What file formats will I receive?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"You get every format you will realistically need for web and print, usually including: Vector files (AI, EPS) for printing at any size SVG for crisp web use PNG with see-through backgrounds High-res JPG and PDF Full file kits are a standard part of our logo design services, so you never get stuck needing a version we did not provide.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"How much do professional logo design services cost?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"It depends on scope. A single mark costs less than a full identity system with animation and brand guides. Good professional logo design services are priced around the work involved, not a random number, so you only pay for what you actually need.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"What actually makes a logo work?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"A logo works when it is simple, memorable, and the right fit for your audience. The strongest marks are: Clean enough to recognize in a split second Scalable from a tiny app icon to a large sign Built around a color and feel that match your brand Clearly different from competitors Our custom logo design services are built around those exact ideas, not trends that age badly.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"Should I redesign my logo or start from scratch?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"It depends on how much brand equity you have. If customers recognize your current mark, a redesign refines what works and fixes what does not. If your logo is brand new or forgettable, starting fresh is usually smarter. We give you an honest recommendation either way.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"How many concepts and revisions do I get?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"That depends on your package, but you always get real options and room to refine. Starter includes a couple of concepts with set revisions, while Signature and Complete Identity include more directions and unlimited revisions. The goal is simple: you walk away happy.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"Can you match my logo to my existing brand colors and style?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"Absolutely. If you already have brand colors, fonts, or a feel you want to keep, we design the logo to sit comfortably inside that world. And if you are starting from zero, we help you pick a palette and style that fits your industry.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"Do you offer logo design services near me, or do you work remotely?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"We work with clients everywhere, fully online. If you searched for logo design services near me hoping for someone local, our remote process gives you the same close, personal experience without the geography: clear calls, shared previews, and direct feedback at every step.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"Why choose a logo design company over a cheap online logo maker?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"A logo maker hands you a template thousands of other businesses can generate too, while a real logo design company gives you an original mark built around your brand alone. A DIY logo costs less today, but a custom one quietly earns its price back for years.\"\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}\n</script>",
            "faqs": [
