ty.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"Can I expect an increase in sales from eCommerce SEO?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"eCommerce SEO can increase product visibility, improve website usability, and attract shoppers with strong purchase intent. Better organic visibility can help qualified visitors discover products and move more easily through the buying process.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"How do monthly SEO services support long-term growth?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"Monthly SEO services keep your website consistently optimized through ongoing content updates, technical improvements, performance monitoring, and search strategy adjustments. These incremental improvements can support long-term growth in rankings, traffic, and leads.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"Why is website SEO optimization important for performance?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"Website SEO optimization helps search engines understand your site while improving technical performance and user experience. A well-optimized website can achieve better search visibility and provide visitors with a smoother experience that supports conversions.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"Should I hire an SEO expert or do it myself?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"You can handle some SEO tasks yourself, but an SEO expert can provide a structured strategy, technical knowledge, and ongoing optimization. Professional SEO services can also help reduce costly mistakes and make it easier to pursue sustainable search growth.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"What role does content 