              "titleIntro": "Google Ads Services We Tailor To",
              "titleHighlight": "Your Margins And Market",
              "description": "Different goals demand different campaign types, so we never run one rigid playbook, and whether you need leads, store sales, or a full account rescue, our google ads management services are shaped around your margins, your market, and the exact customers you want to win.",
