                  "iconName": "TrendingUp",
                  "outcomeText": ""
                },
                {
                  "metric": "",
                  "title": "Consistency That Compounds",
                  "desc": "One great graphic is nice, a consistent system is powerful. Every on brand touchpoint backs up the last, so trust and recognition build month after month. The longer your look stays aligned, the cheaper attention gets and the warmer your audience becomes.",
