            "clientTrust": {
              "enabled": true,
              "heading": "We Ship Real, Working Apps, Not Just Pretty Mockups",
              "description": "Mohsin Designs is an end to end responsible app development company that produces and releases functioning applications from wireframe to live store listing and owns the output rather than passing your project around. It’s simple to mock up a screen, it’s the tougher task that we live in to deploy an app that endures thousands of actual users on hundreds of devices.\n\nWe measure success the same way you do: installations that become active customers, features people really use, and income showing up on your dashboard. So we tackle the inappropriate aspects, including quick startup times, crisp and a build that can handle traffic.",
