          "faqTitleIntro": "Frequently Asked",
          "faqTitleHighlight": "Questions",
          "faqDescription": "",
          "faqSchemaMarkup": "<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n{\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n  \"@type\": \"FAQPage\",\n  \"mainEntity\": [\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"What exactly do UI/UX design services include?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"UI/UX design services include everything that affects how users interact with your application, including the research and analysis stage, and designing the final interface. Services typically include: User research and mapping Wireframe and prototype creation Visual design and design systems Usability testing These services will help increase the conversion of your application.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"What's the difference between UI and UX design?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"UI design is the styling of the application, and UX design is the feel of the application and the ease of the user experience. UI design is all of the colors, buttons, and application layout, while UX design is the flow and the ease of the user reaching their goal. Both elements are important to have a functional application.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"How much does a UI/UX design project cost?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"Pricing is based on the number of screens and the overall project scope. For example, a small landing page redesign is much less expensive than a full application redesign that includes research and testing. We believe in value-based pricing, which means clear pricing based on the potential value of the project.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"How long does a design project take?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"The timeframe for a design project is typically three to eight weeks, based on project scope. A redesign of a small website is a fast project, whereas a large and complex design project is much longer. Our timelines are clearly communicated, so there are no surprises.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"Will good design really increase my conversions and ROI?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"Yes, that’s almost always the case. When your product is built in a way where it’s easily understood with the least amount of effort and/or friction, naturally, more users will perform the desired action. When there are design issues, users will lose trust in your product, which will cost you signups, bookings, and sales.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"Do you design for both websites and mobile apps?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"Yes. Our services extend to UI and UX design for websites, mobile applications, and even large enterprise software systems. Each of these systems has their own design guidelines, which means we have to change the layouts and the design in accordance with the expected end-user experience on the particular system.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"Can you redesign my existing product instead of starting over?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"Of course, many would rather have that. A usability audit will be performed, and redesigns will be offered where the greatest usability and design issues are. You preserve functionality of the product that works, and the issues that are causing you to lose users will be resolved. The product will not have to be rebuilt from the ground up.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"How do I choose the right UI/UX design agency?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"Look for a team that leads with research, shows real results, and explains its process in plain language. A reliable ui ux design agency ties design decisions to business goals and shares honest case studies. It helps to check reviews and ask how they handle testing and feedback.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"What makes a UI/UX design agency worth the investment?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"The right partner pays for itself through higher conversions and lower churn. As a results-focused best ui ux design agency, we treat design as a growth tool, not decoration, so every screen improves how users act, trust you, and stick around.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"What do I actually get when the project is finished?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"You receive everything your team needs to launch and grow. Our ui/ux design services give you: Final UI designs and a reusable design system Developer-ready files and clear specs Interactive prototypes A usability roadmap for future improvements We also stay available after launch to refine and improve as your product grows.\"\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}\n</script>",
