            "titleIntro": "Five Web Design Services Built Around",
            "titleHighlight": "How People Really Buy",
            "description": "We offer five focused web design services, each built for one clear goal, from lead-hungry business sites to conversion-ready online stores, so your budget goes straight to the result your business needs. No two companies sell the same way, so we shape every build around your buyers.",
