            "titleIntro": "Web Development Solutions Built Around",
            "titleHighlight": "Your Actual Goals",
            "description": "Every business converts differently, so your website should never come from a copy-paste build. We start with your goals, industry, and ideal customers, then shape custom website development services around measurable outcomes like leads, sales, signups, and smoother user journeys, not just a prettier homepage.",
            "pillars": [
              {
                "title": "Custom Web Design",
                "desc": "Templates let you blend in. Custom design makes you special. We begin with your brand and your consumer. Our unique web design creates layouts, color and flow based on how people really navigate across a site. The outcome is obviously yours and every visitor is taken to the action that increases your company.",
                "features": []
              },
              {
                "title": "WordPress Web Development",
                "desc": "There’s a reason why WordPress drives a significant portion of the web, it’s adaptable, scalable and easy-to-manage. We’re a WordPress website development company, creating beautiful and secure sites that you can maintain without having to contact a developer. This gives you complete control.",
                "features": []
              },
              {
                "title": "Front End Development Services",
                "desc": "Everything your user interacts with can be found here. Our front end development services use the latest techniques to transform the designs into high speed interfaces that are visually appealing. We pay close attention to the details, and offer web development assistance that performs well regardless of the device.",
                "features": []
              },
              {
                "title": "Back End Development Services",
                "desc": "The quality of the systems your site runs on will determine whether your site will be reliable, efficient, fragile and slow. Our back end development services construct a robust and stable core for your site by managing databases, server logic, and secure data flow, allowing your site to stay quick and efficient.",
                "features": []
              },
              {
                "title": "Full Stack Development Services",
                "desc": "When you need one team that owns the whole build, our full stack development services connect front and back into a single, seamless product. From interface to database, everything is engineered to talk to each other cleanly, fewer bugs, faster delivery, and a site that just works end to end.",
                "features": []
              },
              {
                "title": "WordPress Theme Customization Services",
                "desc": "Bought a theme that's almost right but fighting you on the details? Our WordPress theme customization services reshape it into exactly what you need, custom layouts, new features, faster load times, and clean code under the surface, so you keep what you love and lose everything slowing you down.",
                "features": []
              },
              {
                "title": "E-Commerce Development",
                "desc": "An online store needs to do more than list products; it needs to sell them. We build secure, fast e-commerce sites with smooth checkouts, smart product pages, and friction-free navigation, so shoppers find what they want and actually complete the purchase instead of abandoning a slow, confusing cart.",
                "features": []
              }
            ]
          },
          "strategy": {
            "enabled": true,
            "eyebrow": "04 // HOW IT WORKS",
